{#
One direction's revealed action on a mail row, for the row swipe.

Included once per live direction (see _thread_row.html.twig), so a direction
the resolver makes inert draws nothing at all. The button posts its own URL
and body through mail--message-row, the same write path as the strip's
buttons; the gesture only decides when the press happens.

`side`  left or right: which edge the panel sits on, and so its colour.
`swipe` a SwipeAffordance: url, body, label (a translation key), icon.
#}
<div data-swipe-panel="{{ side }}" class="swipe-panel">
    <button type="button"
            data-swipe-commit
            data-action="click->mail--row-swipe#commit"
            data-swipe-url="{{ swipe.url }}"
            data-swipe-body="{{ swipe.body ? swipe.body|json_encode : '{}' }}"
            class="swipe-panel__action">
        <i class="{{ swipe.icon }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>{{ swipe.label|trans }}</span>
    </button>
</div>
